 lines += ['', '### Reconstruction and physical correspondence','',
 'PO direction was reread with `gh issue view 248 --comments`; the snapshot is in sources/issue248-round5.json. Round 4 evidence, route inputs, build sources and both manufacturing packages are frozen in [round4/](round4/REPORT.md) with round4-sha256.json; all earlier frozen evidence is retained.', '',
 'The preserved evidence contains two different reserve datums: tuning-round uses stored/released Y17.1/Y2.0, while the final round-3 assembly uses Y10.0/Y−5.1 and a 198.400068 mm maximum finished conductor. This reconstruction follows the explicit round-5 Y17.1/Y2.0 instruction. These are the original tuning datum names: the horizontal turn tangent lies 6.55 mm north of the datum and the crown depends on each concentric radius. No prior length or clearance verdict is copied.', '',
 'derive_routes_round5.py reconstructs the separated outlet lanes through the Wing north corridor, low fan into the neck and horizontal concentric R≥5 reserve. Every strand is reassigned using the corrected native correspondence: right Wing pin1 X35.125, pin14 X18.875, with each Wing cavity connected to the same numbered Main cavity. The low pack follows physical Wing lane order and the upper return fan follows corrected Main cavity order. pinmap-round4.json remains immutable; verify_pinmap.py independently parses native pad coordinates/nets before any route sweeps and binds all 28 endpoints to routes-round5.json through pinmap-round5.json. Every OD1 conductor is swept again and independently checked against analytic length and volume.', '',
 'The round-4 tilted reserve and shell-retainer relocation are discarded. The round-3 unrelieved OD6 floor-rooted pillars, inserts, screws, capture tabs and retainer positions (±8,−30) are restored. The stronger round-4 load-path and insert-fit probes are retained as checks. Round-3 tray seating relief is rebuilt from the actual shell. Conservative tray channels include fitted route projections and the entire continuous horizontal-turn translation, buffered 0.87 mm above Z2; the source floor, E support/root, stack and palm checks remain binding. No round-4 shell-rib routing cuts are applied.', '',
 'The tray-left splice boss remains a fresh analytic OD7 boss with the original Ø1.7 pilot. Round 5 additionally replaces its imprinted upper 0.20 mm of floor locally and restores that exact floor region from the unchanged native source before recutting the pilot. This removes the Z2/Z2.000001 boundary implicated in the round-4 17 mm STL failure. The final floor and mesh verdicts are measured below; there is no mesh welding or incidence tolerance change.', '',
 'Binding inputs remain deck Z13.55, provisional plateau Z24.65/q1.50, shell ownership stopping at aluminium plate boundaries, 2.00 mm normal skin, byte-unchanged boards/aluminium manufacturing inputs, GH ceiling/top Z13.20/15.20, Fly Z13.25/15.25, M2×10, fourteen OD1 strands per side, R≥5, ≤200 mm finished including tail-source.json tails, connected reserve 30.20 mm, Fly 170/R5/0.30 mm roof gap and continuous USB/service checks. The 1e−6 mm³ contact threshold and all manufacturing checks are unchanged.', '']
 for pitch in (17,16):
  out=HERE/f'{pitch}mm';get=lambda n:read(out/(n+'.json'));a=get('audit');lf=get('length-fly');s=get('service');v=get('export-verification');ret=get('retention-check');skin=get('tuning-blockers')
  olds=[read(HERE/f'round{r}/{pitch}mm/audit.json') for r in (3,4)];cc=[counts(q['unexpected_interferences']) for q in olds+[a]]
  lines += [f'### Round 5 — {pitch} mm','',f"Exhaustive audit: {a['assembly_solids']} constituents, {a['total_pairs']} unordered pairs; {a['aabb_rejected_pairs']} AABB exclusions, {len(a['intended_pairs'])} explicit own mates, {a['exact_candidates']} exact Commons, {len(a['boolean_errors'])} Boolean errors. Every gate binds to the current assembly-index.json; bounded audit processes checkpoint at 80 new exact operations.",'','| Collision category | Round 3 | Round 4 | Round 5 |','|---|---:|---:|---:|']
  lines += [f'| {n} | {cc[0][n]} | {cc[1][n]} | {cc[2][n]} |' for n in sorted(set().union(*cc))]
  lines += [f"| **Total** | **{len(olds[0]['unexpected_interferences'])}** | **{len(olds[1]['unexpected_interferences'])}** | **{len(a['unexpected_interferences'])}** |",'',f'Full named pairs, exact volumes and bounds are in [{pitch}mm/audit.json]({pitch}mm/audit.json) and collision-map.json.','', '| Side | Routed max mm | Finished max mm | Margin to 200 mm | Connected reserve mm | Minimum bend mm |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
  lines += [f"| {w['side']} | {w['longest_mm']:.6f} | {w['cut_length_upper_mm']:.6f} | {w['cut_length_upper_margin_to_200_mm']:.6f} | {w['minimum_reserve_mm']:.6f} | {min(r['minimum_bend_radius_mm'] for r in w['all_conductors']):.6f} |" for w in lf['conductors']]
